Step to release build
Step 1: Generate a release keystore (if you don’t have one)

keytool -genkey -v -keystore wordpuzzle-release.keystore -alias wordpuzzlekey -keyalg RSA -keysize 2048 -validity 10000


Configure Gradle to use it

Edit android/app/build.gradle:
signingConfigs {
        release {
            storeFile file("wordpuzzle-release.keystore")
            storePassword "YOUR_STORE_PASSWORD"
            keyAlias "wordpuzzlekey"
            keyPassword "YOUR_KEY_PASSWORD"
        }
    }

    buildTypes {
        release {
            signingConfig signingConfigs.release
            shrinkResources false
            minifyEnabled false
        }
    }

